---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const lang = 'en';
const updated = 'June 14, 2026';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Guíñez Galaz Abogados"
  description="How Guíñez Galaz Abogados collects, uses, and protects your personal data under Chilean Law 19.628."
  lang={lang}
>
  <main class="legal-page">
    <div class="legal-container">
      <div class="legal-header">
        <p class="legal-label">GUÍÑEZ GALAZ ABOGADOS</p>
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: {updated}</p>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-body">

        <section>
          <h2>1. Data Controller</h2>
          <p>
            <strong>Guíñez Galaz Abogados</strong>, domiciled at Calle Hernán Correa 2140, Galilea,
            Curicó, Maule Region, Chile, is the controller of personal data collected through
            <strong>www.guinezgalaz.cl</strong>.
          </p>
          <p>Privacy enquiries: <a href="mailto:dguinezlegal@gmail.com">dguinezlegal@gmail.com</a></p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>2. Data We Collect</h2>
          <h3>2.1 Contact form</h3>
          <ul>
            <li>Full name</li>
            <li>Email address</li>
            <li>Type of legal enquiry</li>
            <li>Message text</li>
            <li>IP address (to prevent spam and abuse)</li>
          </ul>

          <h3>2.2 Online payments</h3>
          <p>
            Payments are processed by <strong>Transbank Webpay Plus</strong>. We do not store full card
            numbers. We retain only:
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>Payer name and email (for receipt)</li>
            <li>Service description and amount</li>
            <li>Purchase order number and authorisation code</li>
            <li>Last 4 card digits (provided by Transbank)</li>
            <li>Transaction status and date</li>
          </ul>

          <h3>2.3 Web analytics</h3>
          <p>
            We use <strong>Google Analytics 4</strong> with IP anonymisation enabled.
            Analytics data is only collected if you give your explicit consent via the cookie banner.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>3. Purposes and Legal Basis</h2>
          <table class="legal-table">
            <thead>
              <tr><th>Data</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Legal basis</th></tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td>Contact form data</td>
                <td>Respond to your legal enquiry</td>
                <td>Consent (Law 19.628, art. 4)</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>Payment data</td>
                <td>Process transaction &amp; accounting obligations</td>
                <td>Contract performance &amp; legal obligation</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>IP address</td>
                <td>Prevent spam and rate-limit abuse</td>
                <td>Legitimate interest</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>Analytics (GA4)</td>
                <td>Improve site content and usability</td>
                <td>Consent</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>4. Third-Party Recipients</h2>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Transbank S.A.</strong> — Chilean payment processor. See <a href="https://www.transbank.cl/politica-de-privacidad" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Transbank's privacy policy</a>.</li>
            <li><strong>Supabase Inc.</strong> — cloud database (AWS, us-east-1 or EU). Encrypted at rest and in transit.</li>
            <li><strong>Resend Inc.</strong> — transactional email service for contact notifications and payment receipts.</li>
            <li><strong>Google LLC (Analytics)</strong> — only with consent. Anonymised data. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Google's privacy policy</a>.</li>
            <li><strong>Vercel Inc.</strong> — hosting infrastructure. Server logs retained for 30 days.</li>
          </ul>
          <p>We do not sell or share your personal data with third parties for commercial purposes.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>5. Retention Periods</h2>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Contact messages:</strong> 2 years from receipt, or until you request deletion.</li>
            <li><strong>Payment records:</strong> 6 years (Chilean Tax Authority requirement, Tax Code art. 200).</li>
            <li><strong>IP logs:</strong> 90 days.</li>
            <li><strong>Analytics data:</strong> 14 months (GA4 default).</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>6. Your Rights</h2>
          <p>Under Chilean <strong>Law N.º 19.628 on the Protection of Private Life</strong> you have the right to:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Access:</strong> request what personal data we hold about you.</li>
            <li><strong>Rectification:</strong> correct inaccurate or incomplete data.</li>
            <li><strong>Cancellation:</strong> request deletion when data is no longer needed.</li>
            <li><strong>Opposition:</strong> object to processing in certain circumstances.</li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            To exercise your rights, email <a href="mailto:dguinezlegal@gmail.com">dguinezlegal@gmail.com</a>
            with subject line "Privacy Request". We will respond within 30 business days.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>7. Security</h2>
          <p>
            We implement TLS encryption in transit, encryption at rest (Supabase/AWS), role-based access
            control, Row Level Security on the database, and two-factor authentication (TOTP) for
            administrative access.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>8. Cookies</h2>
          <p>
            We only set <strong>analytics cookies</strong> (Google Analytics) with your explicit
            consent. You may withdraw consent at any time by clearing cookies in your browser or
            declining the cookie banner on your next visit.
          </p>
          <p>We do not use advertising tracking cookies or third-party cookies without your consent.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
          <p>
            We may update this policy periodically. The "Last updated" date at the top of this page
            always reflects the current version. Material changes will be announced via a prominent
            notice on the site.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>10. Governing Law</h2>
          <p>
            This policy is governed by the laws of the Republic of Chile. Any dispute shall be
            submitted to the ordinary courts of Curicó, Maule Region, Chile.
          </p>
        </section>

      </div>

      <div class="legal-footer">
        <a href="/en" class="legal-back">← Back to home</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-page { background: #F5F5F0; min-height: 80vh; padding: 4rem 1.5rem; }
  .legal-container { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .legal-header { margin-bottom: 3rem; }
  .legal-label { font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: .6875rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #C9A84C; margin-bottom: .75rem; }
  .legal-header h1 { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.75rem); font-weight: 700; color: #0D1F2D; margin: 0 0 .5rem; }
  .legal-updated { font-size: .875rem; color: #6B6B6B; }
  .legal-body { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #E8E8E0; padding: 2.5rem; }
  .legal-body section { margin-bottom: 2.25rem; padding-bottom: 2.25rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #E8E8E0; }
  .legal-body section:last-child { border-bottom: none; margin-bottom: 0; padding-bottom: 0; }
  .legal-body h2 { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: 1.375rem; font-weight: 700; color: #0D1F2D; margin: 0 0 1rem; }
  .legal-body h3 { font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: .875rem; font-weight: 600; color: #0D1F2D; margin: 1.25rem 0 .5rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .05em; }
  .legal-body p { font-size: .9375rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #1A1A1A; margin: 0 0 .875rem; }
  .legal-body ul { padding-left: 1.5rem; margin: 0 0 .875rem; }
  .legal-body li { font-size: .9375rem; line-height: 1.7; color: #1A1A1A; margin-bottom: .375rem; }
  .legal-body a { color: #C9A84C; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  .legal-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: .875rem; margin-top: .75rem; }
  .legal-table th { background: #0D1F2D; color: #fff; padding: .625rem .875rem; text-align: left; font-weight: 600; font-size: .8125rem; }
  .legal-table td { padding: .625rem .875rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #E8E8E0; color: #1A1A1A; vertical-align: top; }
  .legal-table tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
  .legal-table tr:nth-child(even) td { background: #F5F5F0; }
  .legal-footer { margin-top: 2rem; }
  .legal-back { font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: .875rem; color: #6B6B6B; transition: color .2s; }
  .legal-back:hover { color: #C9A84C; }
  @media (max-width: 600px) { .legal-body { padding: 1.5rem 1.125rem; } .legal-table { font-size: .8125rem; } }
</style>
